te a job description for a clifford blu employee who works at the cash register, and also monitors the shelves for stock level. Use the keyword 'people' and 'skills'. use only lowercase letters.", "feedback": "{\"response\": \"job description: cash register and shelf stock associate\\n\\nwe are seeking a friendly and reliable team member to operate the cash register and monitor shelves for stock levels at clifford blu.\\n\\nresponsibilities:\\n- greet people warmly and provide helpful customer service\\n- process cash, card, and digital payments accurately\\n- maintain an organized and clean checkout area\\n- monitor shelves and identify low or missing stock\\n- restock products and keep displays neat\\n- report inventory needs to the supervisor\\n- follow store policies and safety procedures\\n\\nskills:\\n- strong people and communication skills\\n- basic cash-handling and math skills\\n- attention to detail\\n- reliability and punctuality\\n- ability to work independently and as part of a team\\n- willingness to learn and support daily store operations\", \"checks\": {\"0:change_case:english_lowercase\": true, \"1:keywords:existence\": true}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-202/memory/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-3380"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "success", "schema_version": 1}, {"case_id": "sha256:a787ad0b463bafdd07452960067ebe9252946a0337d37cc074e4766eb7e69867", "record": {"task_id": "ifeval-1619", "family": "ifeval-source-1619", "sample_id": "sha256:7117b0042b2b542064f0eb07ae756eb28d4bdec9fdf79ad4a959f65bfac0828e", "attempt": 0, "policy_id": "sha256:53801304990b98a1f9f7e0aa33b487fa1b0170eed9d91002ab99029fa5016997", "environment_id": "ifeval-strict-e6890f85757dd84e27ca6df2dd30651dafad28e0", "status": "completed", "passed": true, "complete": true, "instruction": "Write a rap about a new smartphone. At the end of your response add a postscript starting with P.P.S The response must contain at least 6 placeholders represented by square brackets.