ich you; not a map, though I can guide you.  \\nOpen a book, ask a friend, watch the world, and I may appear.  \\nThe more clearly you see me, the less frightening mystery becomes.  \\nWhat am I?  \\nI am KNOWLEDGE: the light that turns wonder into understanding, and understanding into wiser action.\", \"checks\": {\"0:change_case:capital_word_frequency\": true, \"1:change_case:capital_word_frequency\": false}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-202/memory/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-3407"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "failure", "schema_version": 1}], "memory": [{"mode_id": "incidental_uppercase_words_exceed_limit", "description": "The response includes the emphasized uppercase word KNOWLEDGE but also repeatedly uses the uppercase pronoun I, exceeding the requested limit of fewer than five all-capital words. The feedback reports a failed capital-word-frequency check. Only one failure is supplied, so recurrence across cases is not established; no success shares its family, environment, and policy.", "support_case_ids": ["sha256:25c8f017057e9bb3b73f8bf8f2202c0fd5bf87fcb65dddda852dde9a279e79b9"], "counterexample_case_ids": [], "families": ["ifeval-source-3407"], "diagnoser_id": "sha256:8753df9d317681692bd865abf2336f8ec5139b83c55512df2bc6f1bd4d9c59b5", "state": "active", "mastery": {"mode_id": "incidental_uppercase_words_exceed_limit", "mastered": false, "policy_id": "sha256:53801304990b98a1f9f7e0aa33b487fa1b0170eed9d91002ab99029fa5016997", "evidence_refs": ["baseline/train/ifeval-3407"], "schema_version": 1}, "schema_version": 1}]}

