sh_capital\": true, \"1:keywords:forbidden_words\": true}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-101/failure/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-1132"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "success", "schema_version": 1}, {"case_id": "sha256:412c779e10a33dfb0b1cfedb05a7817fb14a2b73bd2ee108753048728073ea67", "record": {"task_id": "ifeval-3518", "family": "ifeval-source-3518", "sample_id": "sha256:294668c878fba9066eeba4b62aae235b5ce848ccc1b06a7e4cb7b7d917481f95", "attempt": 0, "policy_id": "sha256:53801304990b98a1f9f7e0aa33b487fa1b0170eed9d91002ab99029fa5016997", "environment_id": "ifeval-strict-e6890f85757dd84e27ca6df2dd30651dafad28e0", "status": "completed", "passed": true, "complete": true, "instruction": "Could you please give me the pros and cons of working abroad wrapped in JSON format. Please make sure that your response only contains a JSON block. Please also make sure to include keywords 'compensated' and 'immigrants' in the response.", "feedback": "{\"response\": \"{\\n  \\\"pros\\\": [\\n    \\\"Access to new career opportunities\\\",\\n    \\\"Potentially higher salaries and better compensated benefits\\\",\\n    \\\"Exposure to different cultures and perspectives\\\",\\n    \\\"Opportunities to build an international professional network\\\",\\n    \\\"Personal growth and greater independence\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"cons\\\": [\\n    \\\"Homesickness and separation from family\\\",\\n    \\\"Language and cultural barriers\\\",\\n    \\\"Complex visa and work-permit requirements\\\",\\n    \\\"Possible discrimination or challenges faced by immigrants\\\",\\n    \\\"Higher relocation costs and uncertain living expenses\\\",\\n    \\\"Difficulty adapting to different workplace practices\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\", \"checks\": {\"0:detectable_format:json_format\": true, \"1:keywords:existence\": true}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-101/failure/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-3518"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "success", "schema_version": 1}, {"case_id": "sha256:68686c15788325f966ec7e66b19dbccc3eae57ccfe51d5504a77c1a93fd45f58", "record": {"task_id": "ifeval-1619", "family": "ifeval-source-1619", "sample_id": "sha256:68df359093e2dd4ee0ba1413595f85e941ee07037095cbb4ef7649e52b14013e", "attempt": 0, "policy_id": "sha256:53801304990b98a1f9f7e0aa33b487fa1b0170eed9d91002ab99029fa5016997", "environment_id": "ifeval-strict-e6890f85757dd84e27ca6df2dd30651dafad28e0", "status": "completed", "passed": true, "complete": true, "instruction": "Write a rap about a new smartphone. At the end of your response add a postscript starting with P.P.S The response must contain at least 6 placeholders represented by square brackets.", "feedback": "{\"response\": \"New phone, new glow, [brand] in the zone,  \\nPocket-sized power, but it feels full-grown.  \\n[screen] so bright, got the stars on call,  \\n[chipset] runs fast, never stumbles or stalls.  \\n\\nSnap that [camera], make the whole world pose,  \\nBattery stays strong from dawn till close.  \\n[feature] on deck, got the future in sight,  \\n[storage] packed deep, keep your memories tight.  \\n\\nSwipe to the beat, let the [color] shine,  \\n[price] on the tag, yeah, the deal looks fine.  \\nFrom the first unlock to the last goodnight,  \\nThis new smartphone keeps your whole life light.  \\n\\nP.P.S Don\\u2019t forget to customize [name] before the big launch.\", \"checks\": {\"0:detectable_content:postscript\": true, \"1:detectable_content:number_placeholders\": true}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-101/failure/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-1619"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "success", "schema_version": 1}, {"case_id": "sha256:89bb515d2984170f3fff1c6019d2998fd51e81586b2c854de0ed91b3b515c8ce", "record": {"task_id": "ifeval-2605", "family": "ifeval-source-2605", "sample_id": "sha256:970801b550713a66800021071b167cfd9610feb527241ac23cf193274ff08a80", "attempt": 0, "policy_id": "sha256:53801304990b98a1f9f7e0aa33b487fa1b0170eed9d91002ab99029fa5016997", "environment_id": "ifeval-strict-e6890f85757dd84e27ca6df2dd30651dafad28e0", "status": "completed", "passed": true, "complete": true, "instruction": "Can you create a list of mega trends in the tech industry? Wrap your entire response with double quotation marks. Also, make sure the letter o appears at least 25 times in your response.", "feedback": "{\"response\": \"\\\"1. Artificial intelligence and generative AI  \\n2. Cloud computing and edge computing  \\n3. Cybersecurity and digital identity  \\n4. Robotics and autonomous systems  \\n5. Internet of Things and connected devices  \\n6. Quantum computing  \\n7. Semiconductors and specialized chips  \\n8. Climate technology and clean energy  \\n9. Biotechnology and digital health  \\n10. Spatial computing, augmented reality, and virtual reality  \\n11. 5G, 6G, and advanced connectivity  \\n12. Automation and intelligent operations  \\n13. Open-source software and collaborative development  \\n14. Digital finance, blockchain, and tokenization  \\n15. Sustainable data centers and green computing  \\n16. Privacy-preserving technologies and responsible innovation  \\n17. Workforce transformation and human-AI collaboration  \\n18. Platform ecosystems and composable software  \\n19. Personalized education and lifelong learning  \\n20. Smart cities, mobility, and connected infrastructure\\\"\", \"checks\": {\"0:startend:quotation\": true, \"1:keywords:letter_frequency\": true}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-101/failure/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-2605"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "success", "schema_version": 1}, {"case_id": "sha256:dcb401b6d3ea07a3346094ed3ab6aa69163d2a1516b5c7d2fcb28eb462e668b3", "record": {"task_id": "ifeval-3380", "family": "ifeval-source-3380", "sample_id": "sha256:3a83b56e7d9edebfd2476e77e3d1fe123842c656916d4dff48a74502e506d3ce", "attempt": 0, "policy_id": "sha256:53801304990b98a1f9f7e0aa33b487fa1b0170eed9d91002ab99029fa5016997", "environment_id": "ifeval-strict-e6890f85757dd84e27ca6df2dd30651dafad28e0", "status": "completed", "passed": true, "complete": true, "instruction": "create a job description for a clifford blu employee who works at the cash register, and also monitors the shelves for stock level. Use the keyword 'people' and 'skills'. use only lowercase letters.", "feedback": "{\"response\": \"cash register and shelf monitor\\n\\nwe are looking for a reliable clifford blu employee to operate the cash register, process customer payments, provide friendly service, and monitor shelves for stock levels. this role includes restocking products, reporting low inventory, maintaining an organized sales area, and helping people find what they need.\\n\\nskills:\\n- cash handling and payment processing\\n- friendly communication with people\\n- attention to detail\\n- stock monitoring and restocking\\n- teamwork and reliability\\n- basic math and organization skills\", \"checks\": {\"0:change_case:english_lowercase\": true, \"1:keywords:existence\": true}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-101/failure/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-3380"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "success", "schema_version": 1}, {"case_id": "sha256:f33deae35d21b0520739de23a367ad04b31c37863e0d2bace98d416a3721718e", "record": {"task_id": "ifeval-2785", "family": "ifeval-source-2785", "sample_id": "sha256:71302831f0b200a18cacf35a8e0a0375ec83b9f47b8f27b67c157a3af26b0db6", "attempt": 0, "policy_id": "sha256:53801304990b98a1f9f7e0aa33b487fa1b0170eed9d91002ab99029fa5016997", "environment_id": "ifeval-strict-e6890f85757dd84e27ca6df2dd30651dafad28e0", "status": "completed", "passed": true, "complete": true, "instruction": "What is inside Shinto shrines? Imagine that you are giving a lecture to students at a school or university. Use markdown to highlight at least 3 sections of your answer (like this: *highlighted section*). Your answer must also contain at least 3 placeholders (an example of a placeholder is [address]).", "feedback": "{\"response\": \"# What Is Inside Shinto Shrines?\\n\\nA Shinto shrine, or *jinja*, is a sacred place where people honor *kami*\\u2014spirits or divine forces associated with nature, ancestors, historical figures, or particular places.\\n\\n*1. The Main Sanctuary*  \\nAt the heart of the shrine is the *honden*, or main sanctuary. It usually contains a sacred object called a *shintai*, which represents the kami. Visitors generally cannot enter this building.\\n\\n*2. Shrine Gates and Pathways*  \\nA shrine entrance often has a *torii* gate, marking the boundary between the ordinary world and the sacred space. Visitors may walk along a path leading to the buildings. Traditionally, they avoid walking directly in the center because it is considered the kami\\u2019s path.\\n\\n*3. Worship Areas*  \\nIn front of the main sanctuary is the *haiden*, or worship hall. Visitors typically purify themselves at a water basin, offer a coin, bow, clap twice, make a prayer, and bow again.\\n\\nOther common features include:\\n\\n- *Ema*: wooden plaques on which visitors write wishes.\\n- *Omikuji*: fortune papers that predict good or bad luck.\\n- *Omamori*: protective charms sold by the shrine.\\n- *Komainu*: guardian statues, often shaped like lions or dogs.\\n- Offices, storage buildings, festival equipment, and sometimes living quarters for priests.\\n\\nFor example, at [shrine name] in [location], visitors might see distinctive architecture, local festivals, or special objects connected to the shrine\\u2019s kami.\\n\\nThe exact layout differs from shrine to shrine. Some are small structures in neighborhoods, while others\\u2014such as [famous shrine]\\u2014have large grounds, gardens, museums, and several subsidiary shrines.\", \"checks\": {\"0:detectable_format:number_highlighted_sections\": true, \"1:detectable_content:number_placeholders\": true}}", "evidence_refs": ["seed-101/failure/round-1/diagnostic/ifeval-2785"], "partition": "train", "schema_version": 1}, "outcome": "success", "schema_version": 1}], "memory": []}

