  \\nAnd porch lamps tremble in the light.\\n\\nNeighbors call, \\u201cHOLD ON,\\u201d then wade  \\nWith ropes and lanterns through the rain;  \\nThe church bell rings, the school doors close,  \\nWhile muddy rivers cross the plain.\\n\\nBut dawn brings hands and steaming bread,  \\nA tractor, boots, and voices near\\u2014  \\n\\u201cWE RISE,\\u201d they say, \\u201cWE STAND, WE STAY,\\u201d  \\nAnd hope outshines the flooding here.\", \"checks\": {\"0:change_case:capital_word_frequency\": true, \"1:detectable_format:title\": true}}", "raw_metrics": {"pass_rate": {"contractDigest": "sha256:79df20ec4f4d16679ad9cae7de9a0bcc3b755edb113dc05a4458219aa4e62f53", "unit": "ratio", "status": "available", "value": 1, "evidenceRefs": ["sha256:8032ebfcb563bb9fefbdf01b302020d3bf90b0ae9c714d15030ec61987021fdf"]}}}}}, {"ref": {"run_id": "run_a3f7cf0bfcda4e25a94ff5f812021e8b", "kind": "assessment", "digest": "sha256:4f53b66dc68251154595406c39c0ac544c269c298c60b2b457ff527f5540da7a", "visibility": "optimization"}, "value": {"sample_id": "sha256:ba3a004fdae851b5191a03a434aa696e2eb5a6cf3f71da323e5d9514ac5005af", "attempt_id": "sha256:f56d4b5e0c729adec28a1e502a22e8c7bae3a4751e14c0100d7cd8c94b02eb36", "execution_identity": "sha256:a665efe23622f3645818adfaa84056446dee98db521e1a7be9ba050a7cf5edb8", "evidence": {"candidate_id": "anchor", "task_id": "ifeval-3380", "repetition": 0, "scope": "global", "status": "valid", "score": 1, "feedback": "{\"answer\": \"clifford blu is seeking a friendly cashier and shelf stock monitor to serve people, process payments, maintain accurate cash records, and monitor shelves for stock levels. the role includes restocking products, reporting low inventory, keeping the store area organized, and providing helpful customer service.\\n\\nrequired skills include communication, attention to detail, basic math, organization, reliability, teamwork, and the ability to work well with people.\", \"checks\": {\"0:change_case:english_lowercase\": true, \"1:keywords:existence\": true}}", "raw_metrics": {"pass_rate": {"contractDigest": "sha256:79df20ec4f4d16679ad9cae7de9a0bcc3b755edb113dc05a4458219aa4e62f53", "unit": "ratio", "status": "available", "value": 1, "evidenceRefs": ["sha256:d61f4739df938325d4dbe5f212cd78556ae97cab63529290ef77e5a2f83f1c38"]}}}}}, {"ref": {"run_id": "run_a3f7cf0bfcda4e25a94ff5f812021e8b", "kind": "assessment", "digest": "sha256:5b5cc826419bb644a1b774e2b902d8452112197c1f49d7f573a421a27c8ad40a", "visibility": "optimization"}, "value": {"sample_id": "sha256:f4a824b8caf257cd7cd0cb188102be1f90f6639db533801564b47a7bde1d744e", "attempt_id": "sha256:f56d4b5e0c729adec28a1e502a22e8c7bae3a4751e14c0100d7cd8c94b02eb36", "execution_identity": "sha256:a665efe23622f3645818adfaa84056446dee98db521e1a7be9ba050a7cf5edb8", "evidence": {"candidate_id": "anchor", "task_id": "ifeval-3407", "repetition": 0, "scope": "global", "status": "valid", "score": 0, "feedback": "{\"answer\": \"I am born without a mother, yet every mind may raise me. I have no body, but I can travel farther than footsteps. Feed me a WHY, and I return wearing another shape. I grow when shared, shrink when hoarded, and sometimes hide inside a simple pause. Seek me in books, conversations, mistakes, and silence. I am not TRUTH; I am the lantern that makes uncertainty useful. What am I? I turn confusion into direction, ignorance into curiosity, and separate facts from wisdom by asking what they mean. I never diminish when given away. My quiet gift is KNOWLEDGE itself.\", \"checks\": {\"0:change_case:capital_word_frequency\": true, \"1:change_case:capital_word_frequency\": false}}", "raw_metrics": {"pass_rate": {"contractDigest": "sha256:79df20ec4f4d16679ad9cae7de9a0bcc3b755edb113dc05a4458219aa4e62f53", "unit": "ratio", "status": "available", "value": 0, "evidenceRefs": ["sha256:4f835ee7c498d6ba74584c4e79ea86c0dfc7e8801014fd8f6a42930dd3aa7100"]}}}}}, {"ref": {"run_id": "run_a3f7cf0bfcda4e25a94ff5f812021e8b", "kind": "assessment", "digest": "sha256:41a8d50bf6f940bbfa